🩹 终极隔离补丁 V2：暴力解除设定页的高度限制与遮罩！
======================================================== /
/ 1. 彻底废除 145px 高度和 45px 顶距，强制设定页顶栏恢复苗条身材！ /
.chat-detail-screen .chat-header-custom:not(:has(.header-profile-section)),
.chat-detail-screen .glass-header:not(:has(.header-profile-section)) {
background: #f8f8f8 !important; / 恢复设定页的原生浅灰白底 /
